'''AG Super Play''' or '''All Gamers''' is a [[:Category:China|Chinese]] professional esports organization.

==History== 
Super Play.Longzhu was formed in March 2016 and participated in the [[Honor_of_Kings_Champion_Cup/2016|2016 Honor of Kings Champion Cup]] with this name. It was soon purchased in the [[King_Pro_League/2016/Fall|King Pro League Fall 2016]] by the celebrated FPS club All Gamers and changed its name into All Gamers Super Play.

On ''August 12, 2019'', '''AG Super Play''' acquired '''Black Ananas's''' Seat. <ref name="King Pro League">{{cite web|url=https://weibo.com/6074356560/I1RfP4NmA|title=AG has completed the acquisition of the KPL seat of BA|date=2019-08-12|author=AG Super Play}}</ref>

On ''May 10, 2025'', '''AG Super Play''' became the first team to win 4 consecutive titles, becoming the 3rd team to complete the [[Grand Slam]] (including Cross-year Grand Slam) ([[King Pro League/2024/Summer|KPL Summer 2024]], [[King Pro League/2024/Finals|KPL Finals 2024]], [[Honor of Kings Challenger Cup/2024|Challenger Cup 2024]], [[King Pro League/2025/Spring|KPL Spring 2025]]). After [[King Pro League/2025/Finals|KPL Finals 2025]], AG Super Play is the first ever team to win 6 consecutive titles in King Pro League history.

