==History==
'''LGD NBW''' or '''LGD Gaming NBW''' is a [[:Category:China|Chinese]] multigaming team sponsored by Guizhou Laogandie Food. The organization currently hosts teams in ''Dota 2'', ''Overwatch'', ''League of Legends'', ''Counter-Strike: Global Offensive'' and ''Honor of Kings''. '''LGD Gaming''' had the first appearance in [[Honor_of_Kings_Champion_Cup/2017|King Champion Cup 2017]] and again in [[King Pro League/2020/Spring|KPL Spring 2020]] with their new brand, '''LGD Goose'''.

On ''May 25, 2020'', '''LGD Goose''' has their own Home Stadium at ''Hangzhou city'', where the team was established in 2009.

On ''June 1, 2023'', '''LGD Goose''' was officially renamed to '''LGD NBW''', after a change in shareholder.

